# Vitreo · Mosquitto ACL
# Topics: vitreo/<deviceId>/{status,telemetry,event,cmd,ack,config,weather}
# Anything not listed here is denied.

# The ESP32 (and the simulator): publishes its state, receives orders and config.
# TODO(phase 3): restrict each device to its own prefix with `pattern ... vitreo/%u/...`.
user device
topic write vitreo/+/status
topic write vitreo/+/telemetry
topic write vitreo/+/event
topic write vitreo/+/ack
topic read vitreo/+/cmd
topic read vitreo/+/config

# The hub: reads everything, sends orders and publishes config and the
# outdoor weather from AEMET (A10).
user hub
topic read vitreo/#
topic write vitreo/+/cmd
topic write vitreo/+/config
topic write vitreo/+/weather

# The web app: its password ships in the browser bundle, so it can only read
# and send orders. Config changes go through the hub API.
user web
topic read vitreo/#
topic write vitreo/+/cmd
